&lt;script async="" charset="utf-8" src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
-Sat Feb 3&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Monterrey v Leon&lt;/b&gt; - 7pm CT on Univision&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #cc0000;"&gt;dN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
When recruiting a new players &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/football/2018/feb/01/andreas-pereira-alex-ferguson-manchester-united" target="new"&gt;little things can make a huge difference&lt;/a&gt;, like saying Hello in Portuguese to a Portuguese recruit. Like Alex Ferguson did. By Sid Lowe for the Guardian.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #cc0000;"&gt;dN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;LOS LOONS - MINNESOTA UNITED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The first preseason game of the year is on Saturday. But there will be no video stream of the game. So just accept the minimal Twitter updates that we will be getting.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Preseason Friendly Schedule:&lt;br /&gt;
-Sat Feb 3&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;MNUFC v Florida International University&lt;/b&gt; - 1pm CT at EFSC Melbourne Campus&lt;br /&gt;
-Wed Feb 7&lt;br /&gt;
CHANGED: &lt;b&gt;MNUFC v Eastern Florida State College&lt;/b&gt; - Time TBA at EFSC Melbourne Campus&lt;br /&gt;
-Sat Feb 17&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;MNUFC v Charleston Battery&lt;/b&gt; - 6:30pm CT at Carolina Challenge Cup&lt;br /&gt;
