&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;MLS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
The &lt;a href="http://www.espn.com/soccer/major-league-soccer/19/blog/post/3368996/man-city-and-new-york-city-fc-what-the-mix-diskerud-and-jack-harrison-deals-mean" target="new"&gt;Jack Harrison + Mix Diskerud moves by NYCFC and Man City&lt;/a&gt; are a big change for MLS. By Jeff Carlisle for ESPNFC.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
An interview with &lt;a href="https://www.si.com/soccer/2018/02/02/ezequiel-barco-atlanta-united-mls-tata-martino-independiente" target="new"&gt;Atlanta's latest big money signing Ezequiel Barco&lt;/a&gt;. By Luis Migual Echegaray for Sports Illustrated.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Real Salt Lake is not a big money big spending team in MLS - &lt;a href="https://www.deseretnews.com/article/865695510/Real-Salt-Lake-embracing-the-diversity-in-MLS-spending.html" target="new"&gt;they have chosen to do things differently&lt;/a&gt;, and aren't afraid to explain it to anyone. By Jamed Edward for the Deseret News.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Columbus has signed free agent Ricardo Clark from Houston.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style="color: #cc0000;"&gt;dN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;b&gt;AMERICANS ABROAD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Kenny Saief is healthy and playing very well for Anderlecht. &lt;a href="http://www.americansoccernow.com/articles/finally-healthy-saief-wants-to-be-part-of-the-usmnt-rebuild" target="new"&gt;He is ready to impact the USMNT&lt;/a&gt;. By Brian Sciaretta for American Soccer Now.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Rubio Rubin has signed with Tijuana.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;He had played a few games each for Silkeborg in Denmark and Stabaek in Norway last year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
